{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00068",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 2.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Alright, hello, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.46,
      "end_seconds": 5.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 5.65,
      "end_seconds": 8.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.98,
      "end_seconds": 14.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.51,
      "end_seconds": 18.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "It's breathlessness on the stairs, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.35,
      "end_seconds": 22.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.43,
      "end_seconds": 27.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I've had it since last night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.89,
      "end_seconds": 40.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.19,
      "end_seconds": 54.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.25,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. Resting helps a bit. Climbing stairs definitely sets it off. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.56,
      "end_seconds": 58.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Okay, any dizziness as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.19,
      "end_seconds": 67.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, yes, about the same, about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.54,
      "end_seconds": 70.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Have you been feeling tired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.06,
      "end_seconds": 75.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Mm, yes. With feeling tired, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.99,
      "end_seconds": 78.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Any blood in the stool or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.43,
      "end_seconds": 83.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, um, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.76,
      "end_seconds": 86.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Alright, any weight loss or heavy periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.03,
      "end_seconds": 91.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Right, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.9,
      "end_seconds": 95.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.83,
      "end_seconds": 107.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.94,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.06,
      "end_seconds": 115.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, acid reflux, that's already on your record. Good to know. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.54,
      "end_seconds": 132.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.66,
      "text": "Well, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.17,
      "end_seconds": 135.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.42,
      "end_seconds": 138.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Yes, eggs. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.18,
      "end_seconds": 145.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 146.03,
      "end_seconds": 148.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "He takes pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.37,
      "end_seconds": 152.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.98,
      "end_seconds": 155.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.22,
      "end_seconds": 170.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.93,
      "end_seconds": 182.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.72,
      "end_seconds": 206.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 115 beats a minute, respiratory rate 16, temp 37.0 degrees. And BP is 135 over 80, saturation 97 percent. Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.87,
      "end_seconds": 220.26,
      "duration_seconds": 13.39,
      "text": "Not at the moment, uh, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.76,
      "end_seconds": 225.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Okay, I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.01,
      "end_seconds": 226.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.7,
      "end_seconds": 229.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.4,
      "end_seconds": 247.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Heart sounds are normal, I don't hear any murmur."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.66,
      "end_seconds": 249.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.3,
      "end_seconds": 253.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.28,
      "end_seconds": 262.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Your eyelids are pale inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.1,
      "end_seconds": 294.28,
      "duration_seconds": 28.18,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with anaemia of some kind at this stage. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had breathlessness on the stairs, since last night, mild, and no chest pain or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.77,
      "end_seconds": 298.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.43,
      "end_seconds": 302.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.83,
      "end_seconds": 342.3,
      "duration_seconds": 26.47,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'd like to arrange a full blood count for pallor. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let's use ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, for three months. You take it by mouth. That's for possible iron deficiency. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Iron can darken the stools and bother the stomach, so take it after food."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.87,
      "end_seconds": 350.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.18,
      "end_seconds": 358.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "I see. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.92,
      "end_seconds": 361.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.98,
      "end_seconds": 373.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back. Right, just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.97,
      "end_seconds": 384.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "So, I take the ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.42,
      "end_seconds": 388.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.25,
      "end_seconds": 394.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "No, um, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.87,
      "end_seconds": 395.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}